      "side": 1,
      "message": "@hallstrom@google.com, I don\u0027t understand what you are okay with, using the ifdef or using the sysprop ?\n\nMy 2 initial comments are still the same:\n* This CL is not using the sysprop library, but it is adding a sysprop `getLeExtendedScanFilterDuplicates`.\nI would like either to use it or not to add it.\n\nAnd\n* The config specific for floss is usually managed with a ifdef, why this one is a  sysprop ? Is there any reason to have a different config on floss than android ? which of `DISABLED / ENABLED / RESET_EACH_PERIOD` do you intend to use on floss and why not on android too ? Would the performance be improved on android if it was enabled ?\n\nFor the second part, I assume the people that actually know this part of the code should answer here (AKA not me as I do not know what consequence this modification has)",
