      "message": "To clarify my comment, I am okay with using a sysprop blocked for use on Android given the reasoning that it\u0027s more flexible, produces cleaner code, and can be limited to usage on certain platforms. I do think we should align a clear policy on this though, perhaps we should wait for Myles to chime in on the CL @chharry linked first?\n\n@wescande is the system property not used in line 220? Or is it just that you would prefer using the BluetoothProperties class? (If the latter, I agree is good feedback)\n\n[@chharry, plese respond to William\u0027s other Qs re:floss usage as well, thanks!]",
