      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oh I see the confusion, yes I meant using the newly added method in the BluetoothProperties class, added by the cl in system/libsysprop.\n\n(\nI also wonder if the cl in system/sepolicy is usefull since there is already a generic rules to allow bluetooth to read its system properties ([here](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:system/sepolicy/private/property_contexts;l\u003d32;drc\u003dbabb7070a5a4b4cfa1a81dfbaa0c0e620825cfcb)) but I may be wrong on this.\n)",
